@startuml
title Vehicle insurance MLOps — component and configured delivery view
left to right direction
skinparam componentStyle rectangle
skinparam shadowing false
skinparam monochrome true
database "MongoDB source data" as Mongo
[Ingestion] as Ingest
[Validation] as Validate
[Transformation] as Transform
[Model trainer] as Trainer
[Model evaluation] as Eval
database "Model artifact / S3" as Store
actor "Website visitor" as Visitor
[FastAPI form] as API
[Prediction pipeline] as Predict
cloud "Configured CI/CD (not SLA proof)" {
  [GitHub Actions] as Actions
  [Docker image build] as Docker
  database "Amazon ECR" as ECR
  node "Amazon EC2 target" as EC2
}
Mongo --> Ingest
Ingest --> Validate
Validate --> Transform
Transform --> Trainer
Trainer --> Eval
Eval --> Store : conditional model artifact
Visitor --> API
API --> Predict
Store --> Predict : model loading
Actions --> Docker
Docker --> ECR
ECR --> EC2 : configured deployment workflow
note bottom of Eval
Old reported metrics are withheld,
pending leakage-free reevaluation.
end note
@enduml
